Keep a shared results as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared fallen as 0.
Keep a shared columns as 0.
Keep a shared final as 0.
Set columns to 4.
Set final to 19.
To spread from node (a whole number).
If item node of reach is 1, return.
If item node of bricks is 0, return.
Set item node of reach to 1.
The row is node divided by columns.
The column is node modulo columns.
If row is more than 0, spread from node minus columns.
If row is less than 4, spread from node plus columns.
If column is more than 0, spread from node minus 1.
If column is less than 3, spread from node plus 1.

To seed from column (a whole number).
If column is at least columns, return.
If item column of bricks is 1, spread from column.
Seed from column plus 1.

To wipe from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than final, return.
Set item spot of reach to 0.
Wipe from spot plus 1.

To sweep from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than final, Place fallen into results, return.
If item spot of bricks is 1 and item spot of reach is 0, set item spot of bricks to 0, add 1 to fallen.
Sweep from spot plus 1.

For every turn from 0 to 4.
The row is item (turn times 2) of hits.
The column is item (turn times 2 plus 1) of hits.
The place is row times columns plus column.
Set item place of bricks to 0.
Wipe from 0.
Seed from 0.
Set fallen to 0.
Sweep from 0.

For each amount in results, show amount.
